<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38065" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαν-αιρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make away with, destroy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.51
			</span></i>; <i>remove,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.463.54
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.19.9
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαναιρεῖσθαί τινα φαρμάκῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.12.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰς Συρακούσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.10.8
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανῄρηται φαρμάκῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					43.19
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>kill after</i> or <i>together with,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				4.15
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετά τινα ἑαυτόν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			 (pf.
			
				Pass.
			, f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				219a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i><i>Comp.Alc. Cor.</i><i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>), <i>take upon one, enter into,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλίαν</span> Pl.l.c.; esp. into a
			profession, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνην, λατρείαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i><i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Apol.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίον</span></span>] Men.Rh.<i><span class="en">
				p.376S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				149.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πόλεμον</span>
			<i>enter upon</i> a war, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.29.8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of cures, <i>to be employed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>gain,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαν</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				173
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>; in bad sense, <i>incur,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθραν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				355a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>receive</i> as one's share in a division of property, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				234.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>withdraw,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν φιλάνθρωπον νόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>TG</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CG</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
